# ─── Local editor state — never committed ─────────────────────────────────────
# Deployed/editor-local configuration for THIS repo, produced either by running
# deploy.js against the repo itself or just by opening it in the editor. It is
# machine-specific, can contain absolute paths, and historically contained
# credentials.
#
# Patterns are ANCHORED with a leading slash, which matters here:
#   /.kiro/          ignores local Kiro state  — but NOT `kiro/`, which holds the
#                    agent templates and eval-orchestration text the Kiro deploy
#                    reads and which MUST stay committed.
#   /.cursor/        ignores local Cursor state — but NOT `.cursor-plugin/`,
#                    which is the plugin manifest and MUST stay committed.
#
# NOTE: the repo-root mcp.json is the canonical server definition and tool
# allowlist. It is intentionally committed — it holds only placeholders, never
# credentials.
/.kiro/
/.cursor/
.env
.env.local

# ─── Runtime credential and token storage ─────────────────────────────────────
# Written by the MCP server at login time. Contains bearer tokens and client IDs.
# Covered at BOTH the repo root and mcp-server/ (server may write to either
# location depending on its working directory when started).
.sdd-summary/
mcp-server/.sdd-summary/

# ─── Node build output and dependencies ───────────────────────────────────────
# dist/ is the local tsc output, used for type-checking and debugging only.
# mcp-server/bundle/ is deliberately NOT ignored: nothing on the consuming side
# ever runs a build — deploy.js vendors the bundle straight into the target
# project, and a Cursor plugin install clones the repo without building — so the
# bundled server must be committed or there is nothing to run.
mcp-server/dist/
mcp-server/node_modules/

# ─── Summary config lifecycle data ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Contains customer transcripts (PII), eval runs, test data, and credentials.
# Nothing under this directory should ever be committed.
.summaryconfig-lifecycle/

# ─── Local archive (contains credentials, test data, build artifacts) ─────────
archived/

# ─── macOS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Rendered report previews from fixture data (npm run preview:reports)
mcp-server/.reports-preview/
